# SolarSync ☀️

SolarSync is a smart building energy management project that optimizes
solar energy utilization, battery storage, and flexible HVAC loads.

## Objectives
- Increase solar self-consumption.
- Reduce electricity costs and peak grid demand.
- Optimize battery charging and discharging.
- Explore flexible HVAC scheduling.

## Technology
- Python
- NumPy
- Pandas
- PuLP
- Matplotlib
- Mixed-Integer Linear Programming (MILP)

## Current Status
The project currently uses a Python-based optimization model and
synthetic building energy data.

## Future Improvements
- Improve energy optimization.
- Add a building thermal model.
- Implement rolling-horizon control.
- Develop a visualization dashboard.
- Evaluate performance under different operating conditions.

## Data
The current prototype uses synthetic data for simulation.
Results do not represent verified real-world energy savings.

## Disclaimer
SolarSync is a research and development prototype.
It does not currently control real building equipment.
